CustomField.formula:
ABS(
  MIN(
    VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_To_Monday__c), 1, 2)) + VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_To_Monday__c), 4, 2)) / 60,
    VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_To_Tuesday__c), 1, 2)) + VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_To_Tuesday__c), 4, 2)) / 60
  ) -
  MAX(
    VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_From_Monday__c), 1, 2)) + VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_From_Monday__c), 4, 2)) / 60,
    VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_From_Tuesday__c), 1, 2)) + VALUE(MID(TEXT(CC_From_Tuesday__c), 4, 2)) / 60
  )
)
